      "snippet": {
        "line": 737,
        "text": "noncomputable def averagedDefect (B N0 : ℕ) (i : Fin 2) := StateMomentBalances.meanBar (tangentCovariance B N0 0 i.succ) - leadingStress i — the paper's grouped difference ⟨W_{rθ}⟩_Y − Σ_θ^{(0)} (i = 0) and ⟨W_{rz}⟩_Y − Σ_z^{(0)} (i = 1), for the assembled primary tangent covariance"
